    "detailed_description": "Welcome to a new racing bros splitscreen party adventure that will challenge your skills once more.<br>This is the highly anticipated successor to the worst game on Playstation from 2019.<br><br><strong>COOP MODE</strong><br>Try the epic extraction challenge across the world that you probably won't survive.<br>You and your friends have to safely transport a huge golden ball from Morocco to China,<br>while the mafia is trying to steal it from you.<br><br><strong>TIME ATTACK MODE</strong><br>Become a time champion by getting the best speedster records in the time attack mode.<br>This is where you will use your best precision skills to get the best records.<br><br><strong>PARTY MODE</strong><br>Ready for more fun? Fight against or with your friends in crazy party modes by using one keyboard!<br>Stop the trucks, rooftop master, obstacles and many more to come!<br><br><strong>Are you ready for some more racing bros?</strong>",
